<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Privacy Notice | Creative Audio</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --ink: #1a1a1a;
      --muted: #5a5a5a;
      --rule: #d8d0c4;
      --bg: #f7f4ef;
      --accent: #b5470b;
      --card: #ffffff;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.8;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
      padding: 2.5rem 0 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--card);
    }

    header .wordmark {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
          }

    header .wordmark span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    header .tagline {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 4rem 2rem 6rem;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .effective-date {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    h2::before {
      content: '—';
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-right: 0.6rem;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.97rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }

    .contact-block {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--rule);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 2px;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .contact-block p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--rule);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      padding: 2rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wordmark">Creative <span>Audio</span></div>
  <div class="tagline">Internal Tools &amp; Technology</div>
</header>

<main>
  <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Notice</h1>
  <p class="effective-date">Effective Date: March 9, 2026</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Creative Audio ("we," "us," or "our") operates an internal application that accesses the Amazon Advertising API exclusively to manage and analyze our own Amazon advertising account. This privacy notice explains how we handle any data accessed through that integration.
    </p>
    <p>
      This application is not a commercial product or service. It is not offered to the public, and no third parties use or have access to it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Data We Access</h2>
    <p>
      Through the Amazon Advertising API, we access advertising performance data associated solely with our own Amazon Ads account. This may include campaign metrics, ad group data, keyword performance, bid and budget information, and related reporting data.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not collect, store, or process personal data belonging to any individual outside of Creative Audio.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How We Use This Data</h2>
    <p>We use the accessed data for internal business purposes only, including:</p>
    <p>— Monitoring and analyzing our own advertising campaign performance</p>
    <p>— Generating internal reports and dashboards</p>
    <p>— Automating bid and budget adjustments for our own campaigns</p>
    <p>All use of this data is strictly internal to Creative Audio.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell, rent, trade, or otherwise share any data accessed through the Amazon Advertising API with any third party. Data is used exclusively within Creative Audio for the purposes described above.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>
    <p>
      Any data retrieved via the Amazon Advertising API is stored on private, access-controlled cloud infrastructure used solely by Creative Audio. We apply reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect this data from unauthorized access, disclosure, or loss.
    </p>
    <p>
      Data is retained only as long as necessary for internal operational and reporting purposes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
    <p>
      This application does not use cookies, tracking pixels, or any analytics tools that collect user behavior data. No end-user-facing interface is provided to the public.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes to This Notice</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this privacy notice from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any questions regarding this privacy notice, please contact us:</p>
    <div class="contact-block">
      <p><strong>Creative Audio</strong></p>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:aabel@creativeaudio.net">aabel@creativeaudio.net</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  &copy; 2026 Creative Audio &nbsp;·&nbsp; All Rights Reserved
</footer>

</body>
</html>
